{"entryId":"1176","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1176:1","sourceSha256":"13873250b89d0e2174145c56da1a1e601135543a3cc934bda9c6249afb349749","englishSha256":"935efb830ced68413d0d8ca9b68078d73ab49d71f0423d2eb43a0231a193be25","citations":[{"id":"1176:1:citation-01","he":[43,63],"en":[54,66],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Metzia_76b.10"},"reference":"Bava Metzia 76b:10","assessment":"Rav calls the authority Chavivi in both accounts. The wage ruling differs between the two versions.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bava Metzia 76b:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Metzia_76b.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bava Metzia 76b:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Metzia_76b.11"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1176:1:citation-02","he":[65,77],"en":[68,82],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Batra_46a.6"},"reference":"Bava Batra 46a:6","assessment":"Rav’s first-person description invokes his uncle in the artisan case.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bava Batra 46a:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Batra_46a.6"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1176:1:citation-03","he":[78,92],"en":[84,95],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Chullin_32a.7"},"reference":"Chullin 32a:7","assessment":"Rav reports not feeling familiar enough with Chavivi to ask the question.","evidence":[{"reference":"Chullin 32a:7","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Chullin_32a.7"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1176:1:citation-04","he":[94,112],"en":[97,121],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_12b.18"},"reference":"Eruvin 12b:18","assessment":"Rav reports Chavivi on the width of a boundary obstruction.","evidence":[{"reference":"Eruvin 12b:18","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_12b.18"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":